            "text": " to stand above the mesh."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This is an advanced project because the leaf chart must be read correctly and the post stitches worked at consistent tension. Merino or merino-silk fingering is recommended for definition. Allow around 650 m."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
