          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Body"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Work the triangular mesh body following the spine-increase method until wingspan is 130 cm. Work the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "mesh-background"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "mesh"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " evenly across the last plain rows."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Leaf border setup"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Identify the centre point of the lower edge. Place the first "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "leaf-motif-crochet"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "leaf motif"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " at centre, then space further motifs every 18 stitches. Adjust spacing at the two outer edges so the leaves sit symmetrically."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Leaf rows"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Work 3 rows per leaf, using "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "front-post-leaf"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "front post trebles"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " to outline each leaf and chain loops to form the central vein. Continue the background mesh between leaves."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Finishing"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Work 1 round of dc around the entire edge. Block firmly to open the mesh and define the leaf outlines."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
